---
/**
 * "Highest levels of security and audit readiness." Figma instance
 * 15389:33465 (".Container - How Cleartax helps") — the same shared Figma
 * symbol already implemented for other pages (see
 * uae-regional/Integration.astro / global-invoicing/Seamless.astro /
 * oman-regional/Seamless.astro), re-skinned: Security is the default-open
 * row here instead of Compliance, and the Security badge grid uses this
 * page's own copy per the Figma spec (15389:33465 renders that grid in
 * full; the design context for the other three panels isn't captured in
 * this page's frame the way it is on oman-regional, so this page reuses the
 * same Compliance/Integrations/Support panel content verbatim from
 * oman-regional/Seamless.astro — the pattern's other pages already agree on
 * this content, so it's the closest available ground truth).
 * Kept as a per-page copy rather than promoted to `_shared`, same reasoning
 * as the other instances: a shared primitive would force a re-paste of
 * pages that already have this pattern live.
 *
 * SUPPORT ICONS are inlined as <svg>, unlike every other icon in this
 * section, which is a Webflow-hosted PNG. Inline is what makes them work
 * the moment this is pasted — a Figma asset URL dies in 7 days.
 */
